    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "E49EE0BA7377E08B",
      "text": "我正好完成了新作品，會急馳而來\\n有一半是為了想放鬆一下……[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "E49EE1BA7377E23E",
      "text": "但看來即使地區不同，\\n青春期小蘿蔔頭們的生態也沒什麼不同啊。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "E49EE2BA7377E3F1",
      "text": "但是，那個巨蛋！！！！\\c\\n不同的環境調和在一起的樣子\\n實在太能激發人的創作慾望了！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
