      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "11CD18CD595FCE35",
      "text": "結果那些絲逐漸地纏繞住我，\\n把我變成了繭！！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "11CD15CD595FC91C",
      "text": "沒錯……我這才注意到，\\n我自己成了絲的藝術品……\\r\\n真是太棒了！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
