    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "D08478C5B12C054C",
      "text": "初訓家不是自己的寶可夢\\n無法用來交換。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "D0847BC5B12C0A65",
      "text": "稀有的寶可夢\\n無法用來交換。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "D0847AC5B12C08B2",
      "text": "異色的寶可夢\\n無法用來交換。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "26EA43CD4C95C76E",
      "text": "閣下瘋了嗎！？\\n只有１隻寶可夢是無法進行交換的！\\c\\n交換只有在有２隻以上\\n同行寶可夢的情況下才能進行！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_trade_03_01",
      "hash64": "26EA44CD4C95C921",
      "text": "交換寶可夢就是在交換生命，\\n閣下儘管深思熟慮一番吧。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
