    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "57E1D6FA3247509D",
      "text": "哈～哈哈哈！\\n閣下拿到了充滿藝術氣息的勝利啊！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_00_01",
      "hash64": "57E1D5FA32474EEA",
      "text": "和閣下的合作真是不同凡響！\\n我的感性被打磨得越來越敏銳了！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_00_02",
      "hash64": "57E1D4FA32474D37",
      "text": "……這是謝禮。\\c\\n是我下次個展上要發售的商品，\\n搶先一步送給閣下了。[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_battleend_win_00_03",
      "hash64": "57E1D3FA32474B84",
      "text": "這東西的監修花了半年時間，\\n品質相當不錯！[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_gym_kusa_reward_00",
      "hash64": "B18D4AC0CF981C95",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]從寇沙那裡\\n得到了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]隨他去手機殼[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
